msgid "HandlerSpec"
msgstr "HandlerSpec"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:1 of
msgid ""
"The declarative definition of a server handler, as an immutable `pydantic"
" <https://docs.pydantic.dev/>`__ model"
msgstr "服务端处理器的声明式定义，是一个不可变的 `pydantic <https://docs.pydantic.dev/>`__ 模型"

