msgstr ""
":class:`HandlerSpec.Control "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control>`"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:14
#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:17 of
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必填"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:15 of
msgid "``parsing``"
msgstr "``parsing``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:16 of
msgid ""
":class:`HandlerSpec.Parsing "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing>`"
msgstr ""
":class:`HandlerSpec.Parsing "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing>`"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:18 of
msgid "``events``"
msgstr "``events``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:19 of
msgid ""
":class:`HandlerSpec.Events "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Events>`"
msgstr ""
":class:`HandlerSpec.Events "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Events>`"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:20 of
msgid "Optional. Default: no event is recognized"
msgstr "可选。默认值：不识别任何事件"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:22 of
msgid ""
"All regular expressions use the Python :external:mod:`re` syntax. Except "
"the ``sub`` of :class:`TextTransforms.Sub "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransforms.Sub>`:"
msgstr ""
"所有正则表达式均使用 Python :external:mod:`re` 语法。除 :class:`TextTransforms.Sub "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransforms.Sub>` 的 ``sub`` 外："

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:24 of
msgid "A regular expression needs to match the whole text"
msgstr "正则表达式需要匹配整段文本（整串匹配）"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:25 of
msgid ""
"For a list of regular expressions, they are tried in order, and the first"
" matched one is used"
msgstr "若提供了多个正则表达式，则会按顺序逐个尝试，第一个匹配成功的结果将会被使用"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec:26 of
msgid "Named groups listed as required must be present. Other groups are ignored"
msgstr "标为必需的命名分组必须存在，其余分组会被忽略"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control:1 of
msgid "Rules for controlling the server"
msgstr "控制服务端的规则"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control:9 of
msgid "``stop``"
msgstr "``stop``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control:10 of
msgid ":data:`StopMethod <mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethod>`"
msgstr ":data:`StopMethod <mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethod>`"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control:11 of
msgid "Required. How to stop the server"
msgstr "必填。关闭服务端的方式"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control:12 of
msgid "``send_message``"
msgstr "``send_message``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control:13 of
msgid ""
":data:`SendMessageMethod "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethod>` or ``null``"
msgstr ""
":data:`SendMessageMethod "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethod>` 或 ``null``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control:14 of
msgid ""
"Optional. How to send a message to a player. Default: ``null``, not "
"supported"
msgstr "可选。向玩家发送消息的方式。默认值：``null``，即不支持"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control:15 of
msgid "``broadcast_message``"
msgstr "``broadcast_message``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control:16 of
msgid ""
":data:`BroadcastMessageMethod "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.BroadcastMessageMethod>` or ``null``"
msgstr ""
":data:`BroadcastMessageMethod "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.BroadcastMessageMethod>` 或 ``null``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Control:17 of
msgid ""
"Optional. How to broadcast a message to all players. Default: ``null``, "
"not supported"
msgstr "可选。向所有玩家广播消息的方式。默认值：``null``，即不支持"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:1 of
msgid "Rules for parsing the server output"
msgstr "解析服务端输出的规则"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:3 of
msgid "Each line of the server output is processed in the following steps:"
msgstr "服务端输出的每一行都将按以下步骤处理："

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:5 of
msgid ""
"Apply the ``pre_parse`` text transforms. The result is the "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.raw_content` of the info"
msgstr ""
"应用 ``pre_parse`` 文本变换。其结果即为信息的 "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.raw_content`"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:6 of
msgid "Apply the ``line_transforms`` text transforms to the raw content"
msgstr "对原始内容应用 ``line_transforms`` 文本变换"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:7 of
msgid ""
"Match the result against the ``line`` rules. If none of the rules "
"matches, the line is unrecognized, its "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.content` is the raw content"
msgstr ""
"用 ``line`` 规则匹配上一步的结果。若所有规则均不匹配，则该行无法识别，其 "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.content` 为原始内容"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:9 of
msgid ""
"Match the content against the ``player_message`` rules. If matched, the "
"line is a message from a player"
msgstr "用 ``player_message`` 规则匹配内容。若匹配成功，则这一行是玩家发送的消息"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:18 of
msgid "``pre_parse``"
msgstr "``pre_parse``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:19
#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:22 of
msgid ""
"List of :data:`TextTransform "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransform>`"
msgstr ":data:`TextTransform <mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransform>` 的列表"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:20
#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:23 of
msgid "Optional. Default: ``[]``"
msgstr "可选。默认值：``[]``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:21 of
msgid "``line_transforms``"
msgstr "``line_transforms``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:24 of
msgid "``line``"
msgstr "``line``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:25
#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:32 of
msgid "List of regular expressions"
msgstr "正则表达式列表"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:26 of
msgid ""
"Required, at least one. The formats of a line. Named group ``content`` is"
" required, as the :attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.content` of "
"the info. Named groups ``hour``, ``min``, ``sec`` and ``logging`` are "
"optional, as the :attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.hour`, "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.min`, "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.sec` and "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.logging_level` of the info"
msgstr ""
"必填，至少一条。一行输出的格式。命名分组 ``content`` 为必需，作为信息的 "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.content`。命名分组 "
"``hour``、``min``、``sec`` 和 ``logging`` 为可选，分别作为信息的 "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.hour`、:attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.min`、:attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.sec`"
" 和 :attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.logging_level`"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:31 of
msgid "``player_message``"
msgstr "``player_message``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:33 of
msgid ""
"Optional. The formats of a player message. Named groups ``name`` and "
"``message`` are required, as the "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.player` and the "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.content` of the info. A rule "
"is skipped if the player name is invalid. Default: ``[]``, player "
"messages are not recognized"
msgstr ""
"可选。玩家消息的格式。命名分组 ``name`` 和 ``message`` 为必需，分别作为信息的 "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.player` 和 "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.content`。若玩家名不合法，则跳过该规则。默认值：``[]``，即不识别玩家消息"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:38 of
msgid "``player_name``"
msgstr "``player_name``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:39 of
msgid "Regular expression"
msgstr "正则表达式"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Parsing:40 of
msgid "Required. The format of a valid player name"
msgstr "必填。合法玩家名的格式"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Events:1 of
msgid "Rules for recognizing server events"
msgstr "识别服务端事件的规则"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Events:3 of
msgid ""
"Each field is an optional list of regular expressions, matched against "
"the :attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.content` of the info. "
"Default: ``[]``, the event is not recognized"
msgstr ""
"每个字段都是一个可选的正则表达式列表，用于匹配信息的 "
":attr:`~mcdreforged.info_reactor.info.Info.content`。默认值：``[]``，即不识别该事件"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Events:6 of
msgid ""
"Events are only recognized from server output that is not a player "
"message. For rules with the ``name`` named group, a rule is skipped if "
"the player name is invalid"
msgstr "事件只会从非玩家消息的服务端输出中识别。对于含有 ``name`` 命名分组的规则，若玩家名不合法，则跳过该规则"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Events:13 of
msgid "Required named groups"
msgstr "必需的命名分组"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Events:14 of
msgid "``player_joined``"
msgstr "``player_joined``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.Events:16 of
msgid "``player_left``"
msgstr "``player_left``"

