#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.extend:1 of
msgid "Create a new spec by merging the given override onto this spec"
msgstr "将 override 合并到当前定义之上，得到一个新的处理器定义"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.extend:3 of
msgid "Merging rules:"
msgstr "合并规则："

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.extend:5 of
msgid ""
"``control``, ``parsing`` and ``events`` are merged key by key. Keys not "
"present in the override are inherited from this spec"
msgstr "``control``、``parsing`` 和 ``events`` 逐键合并，override 中没写的键沿用当前定义"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.extend:6 of
msgid ""
"Other values are replaced as a whole, including lists, stop methods, "
"message methods and text transforms"
msgstr "其余的值整体替换，包括列表、停服方式、消息发送方式和文本变换"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.extend:7 of
msgid "``name`` is not inherited"
msgstr "``name`` 不沿用"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.extend:9 of
msgid "The override, in the same structure as a handler spec"
msgstr "要合并的内容，结构与处理器定义一致"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.extend:10 of
msgid "The merged handler spec"
msgstr "合并后的处理器定义"

#: ../code_references/server_handler.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "抛出"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.HandlerSpec.extend:11 of
msgid "If the merged handler spec is invalid"
msgstr "若合并后的处理器定义不合法"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec:1 of
msgid "Server handler spec models for declarative handler configuration"
msgstr "服务端处理器定义的数据模型，用于声明式配置"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransforms:1 of
msgid ""
"The available forms of :data:`TextTransform "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransform>`, which modify a line of"
" text"
msgstr ""
"修改一行文本的文本变换，即 :data:`TextTransform "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransform>` 可用的各种写法"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Builtin:5
#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransforms.Builtin:5 of
msgid "Available values of ``builtin``:"
msgstr "``builtin`` 的可用值："

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransforms.Builtin:7 of
msgid "``strip_ansi_color``: Remove ANSI console color codes, e.g. ``\\033[31m``"
msgstr "``strip_ansi_color``：移除 ANSI 控制台颜色代码，例如 ``\\033[31m``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransforms.Builtin:8 of
msgid "``strip_minecraft_color``: Remove Minecraft color codes, e.g. ``§a``"
msgstr "``strip_minecraft_color``：移除 Minecraft 颜色代码，例如 ``§a``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransforms.Sub:1 of
msgid "Replace occurrences of a regular expression, like :external:func:`re.sub`"
msgstr "替换正则表达式的匹配项，类似 :external:func:`re.sub`"

#: of typing.Annotated:1
msgid ""
"A text transform, in one of the forms in :class:`TextTransforms "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransforms>`, determined by the key"
" present"
msgstr ""
"文本变换，为 :class:`TextTransforms "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.TextTransforms>` 中的一种，具体是哪种取决于写了哪个键"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethods:1 of
msgid ""
"The available forms of :data:`StopMethod "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethod>`, which stop the server"
msgstr ""
"关闭服务端的方式，即 :data:`StopMethod "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethod>` 可用的各种写法"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethods.Command:1 of
msgid "Send a command to the standard input of the server"
msgstr "向服务端的标准输入发送一条命令"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethods.Signal:1 of
msgid "Send a signal to the server process"
msgstr "向服务端进程发送一个信号"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethods.Signal:8 of
msgid "Available values of ``scope``:"
msgstr "``scope`` 的可用值："

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethods.Signal:10 of
msgid "``process``: Only the server process, i.e. the process started by MCDR"
msgstr "``process``：仅服务端进程，即由 MCDR 启动的进程"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethods.Signal:11 of
msgid "``process_tree``: The server process and all of its child processes"
msgstr "``process_tree``：服务端进程及其所有子进程"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethods.Signal:13 of
msgid ""
"On Windows, only ``SIGTERM`` is supported, which terminates the process "
"immediately"
msgstr "在 Windows 上，仅支持 ``SIGTERM``，它会立即终止进程"

#: of typing.Annotated:1
msgid ""
"A stop method, in one of the forms in :class:`StopMethods "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethods>`, determined by the key "
"present"
msgstr ""
"停服方式，为 :class:`StopMethods "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.StopMethods>` 中的一种，具体是哪种取决于写了哪个键"

