msgstr ""
"向一个目标发送消息的方式，即 :data:`SendMessageMethod "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethod>` 可用的各种写法"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Builtin:7 of
msgid "``minecraft_tellraw``: The ``tellraw`` command of Minecraft"
msgstr "``minecraft_tellraw``：Minecraft 的 ``tellraw`` 命令"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.BroadcastMessageMethods.Template:1
#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Template:1 of
msgid "A command built from a template"
msgstr "由模板构建的命令"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Template:8 of
msgid ""
"``template`` uses the :external:meth:`str.format` syntax. Available "
"placeholders:"
msgstr "``template`` 使用 :external:meth:`str.format` 语法。可用的占位符："

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Template:10 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``{target}``: The target of the message"
msgstr "``{target}``：消息的目标"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Template:11 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``{message}``: The message, formatted according to ``message_format``"
msgstr "``{message}``：消息内容，按 ``message_format`` 格式化"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Template:13 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use ``{{`` and ``}}`` for literal braces. Placeholders with conversions "
"or format specs, e.g. ``{message!r}``, are not allowed"
msgstr "字面量花括号写作 ``{{`` 和 ``}}``。不支持 ``{message!r}`` 这类带转换符或格式说明符的占位符"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Template:15 of
msgid "Available values of ``message_format``:"
msgstr "``message_format`` 的可用值："

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Template:17 of
msgid "``json``: A JSON text component"
msgstr "``json``：JSON 文本组件"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Template:18 of
msgid "``plain``: Plain text, with Minecraft color codes like ``§a`` removed"
msgstr "``plain``：纯文本，并移除 ``§a`` 等 Minecraft 颜色代码"

#: of typing.Annotated:1
msgid ""
"A send message method, in one of the forms in :class:`SendMessageMethods "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods>`, determined by the"
" key present"
msgstr ""
"消息发送方式，为 :class:`SendMessageMethods "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods>` 中的一种，具体是哪种取决于写了哪个键"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.BroadcastMessageMethods:1 of
msgid ""
"The available forms of :data:`BroadcastMessageMethod "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.BroadcastMessageMethod>`, which "
"broadcast a message"
msgstr ""
"广播消息的方式，即 :data:`BroadcastMessageMethod "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.BroadcastMessageMethod>` 可用的各种写法"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.BroadcastMessageMethods.Builtin:6 of
msgid ""
"Same as :class:`SendMessageMethods.Builtin "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Builtin>`, with a "
"fixed ``target``"
msgstr ""
"与 :class:`SendMessageMethods.Builtin "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Builtin>` 相同，但使用固定的 "
"``target``"

#: mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.BroadcastMessageMethods.Template:8 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Same as :class:`SendMessageMethods.Template "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Template>`, except "
"that only the ``{message}`` placeholder is available"
msgstr ""
"与 :class:`SendMessageMethods.Template "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.SendMessageMethods.Template>` 相同，但仅可使用 "
"``{message}`` 占位符"

#: of typing.Annotated:1
msgid ""
"A broadcast message method, in one of the forms in "
":class:`BroadcastMessageMethods "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.BroadcastMessageMethods>`, determined "
"by the key present"
msgstr ""
"消息广播方式，为 :class:`BroadcastMessageMethods "
"<mcdreforged.handler.handler_spec.BroadcastMessageMethods>` "
"中的一种，具体是哪种取决于写了哪个键"

